  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "palette",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -300,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "Yosuku's layouts and type (Sora, Inter, JetBrains Mono) in Mezo's palette.\n\nOne red. Mezo off-red #FF004D marks identity and your next action: fills with black labels (5.4:1), strike lines, range bands, headline type.\nSmall words stay ink #171717. When one needs the accent, the red moves into a shape: underline, top bar, swatch.\nUP is green (#06C167 fill, #03703C text). DOWN is ink, so nothing competes with the brand red.\nSand #F4F0ED page, white cards. The wine gradient appears once, on the pool-update rule."
    },
    {
      "id": "sample",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": -300,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "Numbers are sample values, priced with the live contract's math (5-min BTC, DVOL 38.9).\nWallet marks on Connect are the official icons shipped in Mezo Passport's wallet kits."
    },
    {
      "id": "dark-note",
      "page": "page-3",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 460,
      "text": "Yosuku today is dark-first. This keeps that canvas and swaps only the accent to Mezo off-red. Pick this if the Mezo version should feel like the same app."
    }
